Caus. -षादयति, to cause to despond or despair, vex, grieve, afflict, MBh.;
 B. &c.

2. वि-ष्ठा (√ स्था; for 1. विष्ठा See p. 996, col. 2) Ā. -तिष्ठते (cf. Pāṇ. i, 3, 22; Ved. and ep. also P.),
